      ],
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "src/util/childEnv.ts exists and exports `sanitizeChildEnv(env?: NodeJS.ProcessEnv): NodeJS.ProcessEnv`. Default `env` is `process.env`.",
        "sanitizeChildEnv strips: VERSE8_ACCESS_TOKEN, every key matching /^VERSE8_.*_MCP_URL$/, VERSE8_API_URL, VERSE8_AGENT8_BACKEND_URL, VERSE8_CREATE_URL.",
        "sanitizeChildEnv returns a NEW object (does not mutate the input).",
        "src/tools/preview.ts no longer defines its own `sanitizedChildEnv`; the spawn call (line ~662) uses the shared helper.",
        "tests/unit/childEnv.test.mjs has at least 5 cases: VERSE8_ACCESS_TOKEN stripped, VERSE8_IMAGE_MCP_URL stripped, VERSE8_API_URL stripped, unrelated env passed through, input not mutated.",
