      "priority": 2,
      "passes": true,
      "files": [
        "src/context/gitIgnore.ts (new, ~40 LOC)",
        "src/tools/attach.ts (call from applyAttachmentArtifacts)",
        "tests/unit/gitIgnore.test.mjs (new)"
      ],
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "src/context/gitIgnore.ts exports `ensureVerse8GitIgnore(projectDir: string): { status: 'created' | 'updated' | 'already-present', path: string }`.",
        "ensureVerse8GitIgnore writes/updates `<projectDir>/.verse8/.gitignore` with these entries (one per line): `preview.log`, `mcp.log`, `mcp.log.*`, `mcp.log.link`, `*.env.tmp-*`, `.env.tmp-*`.",
        "When `.verse8/.gitignore` already exists, ensureVerse8GitIgnore APPENDS missing entries (preserves existing user-added lines); never duplicates entries.",
        "Idempotent: running twice on the same dir returns `already-present` on the second call.",
        "applyAttachmentArtifacts (in src/tools/attach.ts) calls ensureVerse8GitIgnore as part of the attach sequence; result envelope gains an `installed.gitIgnore` field.",
        "AttachResult type updated to include the new field (TypeScript narrowing intact).",
        "tests/unit/gitIgnore.test.mjs has at least 6 cases: created on fresh dir, idempotent re-run returns already-present, existing user entries preserved, missing entries appended, no duplicates after partial coverage, mode 0644.",
        "Existing skillWriter / envFile tests continue to pass.",
        "tsc compiles cleanly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "US-M2-3",
      "title": "Skills-vendor subtree SHA pin (content-hash, not git-sha — verse8-mcp not in own git repo here)",
      "priority": 3,
      "passes": true,
      "files": [
        "package.json (new top-level field `verse8.skillsVendor.sha`)",
        "scripts/check-subtree-sha.sh (new)",
        "scripts/compute-subtree-sha.sh (new helper for maintainers)"
      ],
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "scripts/compute-subtree-sha.sh computes a deterministic SHA over `skills-vendor/` (sorted file list + per-file sha256 of content), prints the digest to stdout.",
        "scripts/check-subtree-sha.sh recomputes the SHA and compares against `package.json :: verse8.skillsVendor.sha`. Exits 0 on match; exits 1 with diff guidance on mismatch.",
        "package.json gains a top-level `verse8` object with `skillsVendor.sha` set to the current computed digest (recorded as the pinned baseline).",
        "package.json gains an `npm run check:subtree-sha` script that invokes scripts/check-subtree-sha.sh.",
        "Running `npm run check:subtree-sha` from the repo root succeeds (exit 0).",
        "Running `npm run check:subtree-sha` after artificially modifying any file in skills-vendor exits 1 with an actionable error pointing at the recompute command."
      ]
    },
